X	  To default automatically to C+ mode for C programs, your .emacs_pro
X	  file should contain lines in the form:-
X	 	(autoload "c+mode" ".....maclib/c+mode.ml")
X		(auto-execute "c+mode" "*.c")
X		(auto-execute "c+mode" "*.h")
X	  
X
